<title>GERMANY: Munich Re to get 789 mln DM for Degussa.</title>
<headline>Munich Re to get 789 mln DM for Degussa.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Munich Re said it would get 789 million marks from the sale of its 9.9 percent Degussa stake to diversified utilities group Veba AG.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
